---
/**
 * QuickAnswer
 * ----------
 * The 2-sentence AIO-targeted block that lives directly under the hero.
 *
 * Why this exists:
 *   - Brave AI Indexing skill: every high-intent page needs a labelled,
 *     immediately-extractable answer block that AI engines can lift into
 *     their summaries. The same pattern already ships on the facial hub
 *     (facial/index.astro), the journal articles (journal/[slug].astro)
 *     and the area pages (service-areas/[slug].astro) — the homepage was
 *     the missing one.
 *   - LLM Optimization Agent Module 4.1: homepage content must contain a
 *     2-sentence "Quick Answer" block in AIO-triggerable format.
 *   - SpeakableSchema (src/components/schema/SpeakableSchema.astro) already
 *     targets `cssSelector: [".quick-answer", ".faq-section"]`. The
 *     homepage now ships both, so voice search and AIO extractors have
 *     explicit targets on the highest-traffic page.
 *
 * The summary copy is the locked wording from the plan: brand, service,
 * city, neighborhood, license, years, all-skin-types, four service
 * categories, and the verified 40 five-star Google review count. It is
 * entity-dense by design — every SEO audit called for homepage entity
 * density, and this block concentrates it where the AIO extractors look
 * first.
 *
 * Visual treatment mirrors the existing pattern on other hub pages:
 * rose-tinted left border, slight weight bump, no background fill. Reusing
 * the same look keeps the site visually consistent without introducing a
 * new component class.
 */
---

<section
  aria-labelledby="quick-answer-label"
  class="bg-porcelain border-y border-line"
>
  <div class="wrap py-10 md:py-12">
    <p
      id="quick-answer-label"
      class="t-eyebrow mb-3 text-rose"
    >
      Quick answer
    </p>
    <p
      class="quick-answer t-body text-[1.0625rem] md:text-[1.125rem] font-medium max-w-[68ch] leading-[1.55]"
    >
      KIAMO Skin is a facial and scalp studio in Mission Hills, San Diego, run by a
      licensed esthetician with 7+ years of experience treating every skin type. The
      studio performs corrective facials, pigmentation correction, acne treatment, and
      Keravive scalp therapy, with 40 five-star Google reviews.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
